In article <34106@mirror.UUCP> mguyott@mirror.UUCP (Marc Guyott) writes:

   You can also rust proof armor by dipping it into a potion of Holy
   Water.  Reading a scroll of enchant armor while confused is an
   alternative method for blessing a piece of armor.

Not true.  Blessed armor and weapons are unlikely to be rusted/corroded,
but there is still a chance they will rust/corrode.  Rustproof is not the
same as blessed.  Reading a scroll of enchant armor while confused will
not bless the armor.

